{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2023-03-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER CEO FRÉDÉRIC LISSALDE TO BE HONORED FOR HIS ACCOMPLISHMENTS IN THE AUTOMOTIVE INDUSTRY', 'text': 'AWARDED THE PRESTIGIOUS NESSIM HABIF PRIZE PRESENTED BY THE INGÉNIEURS ARTS ET MÉTIERS COMMUNITY CEREMONY HELD IN PARIS ON MARCH 6 PARIS , MARCH 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EACH YEAR, THE RENOWNED FRENCH SOCIETY OF ENGINEERS "INGÉNIEURS ARTS ET MÉTIERS", RECOGNIZES AN OUTSTANDING MEMBER OF ITS COMMUNITY FOR THEIR ACHIEVEMENTS. FRÉDÉRIC LISSALDE WAS CHOSEN AS THE WINNER OF THIS YEAR\'S NESSIM HABIF AWARD IN HONOR OF HIS INTERNATIONAL PROFESSIONAL ACCOMPLISHMENTS IN THE AUTOMOTIVE INDUSTRY.'}